# Mailmap — normalizes author identities for `git shortlog`, GitHub contributor
# lists, and pkg.go.dev/legacy stats. Format:
#   Proper Name <proper@email> Commit Name <commit@email>
#
# 2026-09-18: five commits were authored as "Unknown Author
# <unknown@example.com>" (a misconfigured git identity); attribute them to the
# maintainer so they stop showing up as an anonymous contributor.

Lars Artmann <git@lars.software> <unknown@example.com>
